| `scripts/run_make_target.py` | Runs one make target as a gate only when its effect label falls inside the configured gate effects, and fails a run that changed what git lists; `scripts/apply_refactor.py` imports it to gate each edit. | `python3 scripts/run_make_target.py <target>` | [`make_targets.gate_effects`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Sees only what git lists: a write to an ignored path passes. The `gate runner` row below is the feature this module carries. | [limits-and-troubleshooting.md](../guides/limits-and-troubleshooting.md) | always |
